      "printed_page": null,
      "kind": "text",
      "quote": "Revenue increased by 2.9% with key drivers including volume growth and higher Markets & Treasury (M&T) income, partially offset by higher customer-related remediation charges and the impact from business disposals and run-offs. Excluding M&T income, revenue rose 1.4% over the year, and increased 4.3% 2H25 compared with 1H25.",
