      "pdf_page": 5,
      "printed_page": null,
      "kind": "text",
      "quote": "Expenses increased by 4.6% including $130 million related to payroll review and remediation charges. Excluding payroll review and remediation charges, expenses rose 3.2% reflecting higher personnel and technology related costs, partially offset by productivity benefits and lower costs relating to the Group's Enforceable Undertaking with AUSTRAC.",
